<h2 id="step-3-tool-execution-making-them-work">Step 3: Tool Execution (Making Them Work)</h2>

<p>Here’s where things get interesting. When the model responds, it might:</p>

<ul>
  <li>Return a text answer (we’re done!).</li>
  <li>Request one or more tool calls (continue!).</li>
</ul>

<p>Our agent needs to detect tool calls and execute them (<a href="https://github.com/gscalzo/Nimbo/blob/main/Sources/NimboCLI/Agent.swift">Agent.swift</a>):</p>

