<h3 id="what-this-tells-us">What This Tells Us</h3>

<p>These examples demonstrate three key superpowers of AI agents:</p>

<ol>
  <li><strong>Tool chaining</strong>: the agent decides which tools to use and in what order.</li>
  <li><strong>Context awareness</strong>: it remembers what it did (because it’s all in the history!).</li>
  <li><strong>Creative reasoning</strong>: it doesn’t just execute commands; it thinks about what would make the outcome better.</li>
</ol>

<p>The real magic? <strong>You didn’t program any of this logic</strong>. You just:</p>

<ul>
  <li>Described what each tool does.</li>
  <li>Gave the agent access to them.</li>
  <li>Let the language model figure out the rest.</li>
</ul>

